OL,5,G0232 The Documentary
OL,6,     FForty years ago an iceberg twice
OL,7,     Fthe size of London broke away from
OL,8,     Fthe Antarctic ice shelf.
OL,9,     FGlaciologist Catherine Walker
OL,10,     Fexplores the birth, life and death
OL,11,     Fof megaberg A23a.
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FRon Forrester's plane was lost
OL,17,     Fjust before the end of the Vietnam
OL,18,     Fwar. His daughter Karoni made it
OL,19,     Fher mission in life to find out
OL,20,     Fwhat happened.
