OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1995 Octavia E Butler became
OL,7,     Fthe first author to receive a
OL,8,     FMacArthur "genius" award for her
OL,9,     Fscience-fiction writing. During
OL,10,     Fher career, she overcame poverty,
OL,11,     Fracism and sexism.
